  <swc:ConferenceEvent rdf:about="http://opendiscovery.org/rdf/Conferences/ITC-2023/General">
    <od:toConferenceSeries rdf:resource="http://opendiscovery.org/rdf/ConferenceSeries/ITC"/>
    <rdfs:label>The First International TRIZ Conference ITC-2023: Innovation in Challenging Times</rdfs:label>
    <ical:dtend rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-09-02</ical:dtend>
    <ical:dtstart rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2023-08-30</ical:dtstart>
    <ical:location>Graz Technical University (Austria) and Online</ical:location>
    <ical:summary xml:lang="en">The event is organized by the International TRIZ Official Association - (MATRIZ Official), Graz University of Technology, and Higher College for Engineering Wolfsberg.

We invite everybody, who is engaged in TRIZ research, development, and practical applications, as well as those who are interested in TRIZ and desire to meet TRIZ professionals and learn more about TRIZ, to the ITC-2023.

On August 30, several tutorials are scheduled. On the same day our “Solve It on the Spot” session will be held where participants will have the opportunity to present a real world challenge they are facing and solve it under the guidance from our expert panel.

We plan to conduct a session on TRIZ in Education. In this session, leading developers and practitioners of TRIZ in Education will discuss the modern methods of developing creative and critical thinking skills in grade school and university students. Interestingly, these same methods are very effective when working with adults in various fields of human activity. We will discuss the modern methods for the development of the vital skills, required for succeeding in the dynamic world we live in today. We will make pertinent details for this session available by the end of May.

On the last day of the conference a special session of TRIZ Master Certification Committee will take place, where candidates will defend their TRIZ Master theses. This session is open to all participants of the conference. </ical:summary>
    <ical:url rdf:resource="https://www.matriz-official.net/index.php/events/2-uncategorised/31-itc-2023-page"/>
  </swc:ConferenceEvent>
